<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of seven bln skr T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of seven bln skr T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of Treasury bills worth seven billion crowns.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on April 29, it said, and bids are due by 1030 GMT on Tuesday. Settlement date is May 2.</p>
